@startuml
|Admin|
start
:Create account\n(WM / Seller / Dist / Retailer);
if (Wealth Manager?) then (yes)
  :Assign investment areas\n(one two or all three);
endif
|System|
:Store account;
|User receiving access|
:Enter mobile and password;
|System|
:Authenticate;
|User receiving access|
if (Valid credentials?) then (no)
  :Show invalid credentials;
  stop
endif
if (Blocked or deleted?) then (yes)
  :Show blocked or deleted;
  stop
endif
if (Application?) then (Wealth Manager app)
  :Always show area selection page;
  :Enter only authorised areas;
else (Seller app)
  :Go to Seller dashboard;
endif
stop
note right
  No onboarding/KYC/password-change
  in this proposed flow.
  Credential delivery: unconfirmed.
end note
@enduml
